  {"clause_id": "c045", "issues": [
    {"issue": "\"Upon expiration of the Primary Term and completion of continuous drilling operations\" states two triggers without saying whether both must occur, so the date on which the lease contracts to producing units is indeterminate. Paragraph 4(e) meanwhile keeps the whole lease alive during continuous drilling, making the moment of partial termination a matter of construction.", "type": 1, "prob": 0.32}
